{
  "slug": "indian-contracts-drafting",
  "name": "Indian Contracts Drafting",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "For every transactional advocate, in-house counsel, and law-firm associate who drafts the day-to-day contracts that underpin Indian commerce — from a startup's MSA to a family-business shareholders agreement to the last Will of a senior citizen — this open-source Claude Code plugin standardises commercial-contract drafting under Indian law. Contract-config-aware: the structural skeleton is uniform across contract types; governing law, seat of arbitration, courts of exclusive jurisdiction, stamp-duty State, and registration State are user-supplied. Battle-tested for Master Service Agreement, Non-Disclosure Agreement, Employment Agreement and Independent Contractor agreement, Lease Deed and Leave & License agreement, Sale Deed of immovable property, General and Special Power of Attorney (post-Suraj Lamp discipline), Shareholders Agreement (Companies Act 2013 + AoA alignment), Last Will and Testament, Loan Agreement, and standalone Arbitration Agreement. Six-agent drafting pipeline (Reader → Format → Drafter → Verifier → Refiner → Overseer) + shared contract drafting base with the Indian Contract Act 1872, Transfer of Property Act 1882, Registration Act 1908, Indian Stamp Act 1899, Arbitration and Conciliation Act 1996, and DPDP Act 2023 discipline encoded. The finished product is an execution-ready contract or instrument the chamber can stamp, sign, and execute the same day.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills** and **6 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `_contract_drafting_base` (Universal Indian-contract pleading skeleton), `_drafting_common` (Shared reference for all contract / conveyancing / estate drafting skills), `arbitration-clause-draft` (Draft a standalone Arbitration Agreement OR a robust Arbitration Clause for embedding in any commercial contract), `commercial-service-agreement-draft` (Draft a Master Service Agreement (MSA) / Statement of Work (SoW) / Service Agreement for the provision of…), `employment-agreement-draft` (Draft an Employment Agreement (employer-employee relationship) OR an Independent Contractor Agreement (principal-contractor relationship)), `gpa-spa-draft` (Draft a Power of Attorney — General Power of Attorney (GPA) or Special Power of Attorney (SPA)), `lease-deed-draft` (Draft a Lease Deed (Section 105 of the Transfer of Property Act 1882) or a Leave & License…), `loan-agreement-draft` (Draft a Loan Agreement (or Facility Agreement) between Lender and Borrower), and 4 more\n- **Agents** (6): `drafter` (Third agent in Indian contracts drafting pipeline), `format` (Second agent in Indian contracts drafting pipeline), `overseer` (Sixth and final agent in Indian contracts drafting pipeline), `reader` (First agent in Indian contracts drafting pipeline), `refiner` (Fifth agent in Indian contracts drafting pipeline), `verifier` (Fourth agent in Indian contracts drafting pipeline)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install indian-contracts-drafting@claude-community` from `Wolfgangrush/indian-contracts-drafting-litigation`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
